A||||6||AkursedX||A Little Rant and a Kill Story||||8||
Z||000000||AkursedX||10-31-2001||09:23 PM||||Ok, well let me start of with my rant....<P>I am getting so sick and tired of people trying to insitgate races with me!!!  In the past 3 days, I have had 12 people in their cars revving me and trying to get me to race.  <P>On person in a POS mid-80's T-bird thinks he's so cool revving his motor and doing a power break at a stoplight when he is going in the OPPOSITE direction of me!!!  And my side of the street turns green first so as I drive by, he is doing his brun looking at me with this "I'm cool" look on his face while I'm rolling my eyes at his stupidity and his crappy car.<P>Now maybe I'm a minority but I don't understand this need to race.  I mean I have raced before, but I have never been the one to incite it.  Personally, the time that I drive my fastest is when I'm alone and have a nice twisty road ahead of me  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I'm not a fan of straight line racing. <P>But, I finally got annoyed enough to get myself into a good run.  I'm drving in the middle lane of the 33 (3-lane expressway)  and there is this big 4x4 next to me that decides to floor it as soon as he gets next to me and roars off to a good lead before I finally decide to give chase.  I end up getting up to 120mph and I utterly blow the doors off this truck.  And then the guy has the gall to give me the finger as I slow down and he passes me by WTF???  If he didn't want to lose, he should of never tried to race me!!  <P>I guess it's one of those curses of owning a nice car.  <P>Ok I'm done ranting now.<P>Disclaimer:  I know racing is bad, there were no boxes of kittens on the road, and it was 2am and I only passed one other car.<P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||8
