Z||000004||AkursedX||10-31-2001||10:56 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 85ZainoGT:<BR><B>so 4 diff cars revved at you, and you raced a 4x4?  dunno bout that one... whatever floats your boat though   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>It was just a spur of the moment reaction.  I didn't even realize what it was until I had already given chase.  <P>The funny thing is, of all the cars in the past 3 days that have revved me, only 2 have been decent cars(Honda Prelude Si and a contour SVT)  The rest were things like: A Ford Taurus, the T-Bird previousley mentioned, a CRX that was rear-ended badly, 2 Old Rusty Honda Accords, The 4x4, a Dodge Dakota, A Beetle, and a older buick regal with lowrider rims.    None of these people really had anything that they should even bother showing off.<BR>||||reg||1
